# A shopkeeper with a memory. Binds to every Kweebec merchant.

npc: Kweebec_Merchant
start: returning when $met
start: first_meeting

== first_meeting
Well met, traveler. I'm the Rootling Merchant, and this is my humble stall.
<<set $met = true>>
<<jump hub>>

== returning
<<if hour() >= 20 or hour() < 5>>
  Back again, {player}? It's late for trading.
<<else>>
  Ah, {player}. Back again.
<<endif>>
<<jump hub>>

== hub
-> What do you sell?
    A little of everything, and most of it useful.
    <<shop>>
-> I'm hungry and have no coin. <<if not $got_bread>>
    <<jump charity>>
-> Where can I find the temple? <<if not $told_temple>>
    <<jump temple>>
-> I should be going.
    Safe travels. Mind the Trorks on the north road.
    <<end>>

== charity
Hm. A traveler with an empty purse is a weary sight.
<<if has("Ingredient_Life_Essence", 5)>>
  But you carry essence. Trade me five and I'll give you bread and a smile.
  -> Deal.
      <<take Ingredient_Life_Essence 5>>
      <<give Food_Bread 2>>
      <<set $got_bread = true>>
      <<attitude friendly>>
      Pleasure doing business.
      <<jump hub>>
  -> No, thank you.
      Suit yourself.
      <<jump hub>>
<<else>>
  Take this, then. One loaf, and don't tell the Elder I'm going soft.
  <<give Food_Bread 1>>
  <<set $got_bread = true>>
  <<jump hub>>
<<endif>>

== temple
North, past the whispering woods. Look for the jagged peaks, the temple sits just beyond.
<<set $told_temple = true>>
<<objective Objective_ReachLocation>>
-> Thank you.
    <<jump hub>>
